OL,3,AKing Charles and Elton John pay tribute
OL,4,Ato Australian music legend Molly       
OL,5,AMeldrum                                
OL,7,FKing Charles and Elton John have paid  
OL,8,Ftribute to Australian music industry   
OL,9,Flegend Molly Meldrum, who died aged 83 
OL,10,Fafter a long illness.                  
OL,12,FMeldrum's family said he "passed away  
OL,13,Fpeacefully" at a hospital in Melbourne 
OL,14,Fin the early hours of Monday morning.  
OL,16,FThe music promoter and broadcaster,    
OL,17,Fborn Ian Alexander Meldrum, helped     
OL,18,Fdefine the nation's music tastes for   
OL,19,Fdecades, championing local artists like
OL,20,FINXS and Kylie Minogue and global acts 
OL,21,Flike Abba.                             
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
