OL,3,AKing Charles and Elton John pay tribute
OL,4,Ato Australian music legend Molly       
OL,5,AMeldrum                                
OL,7,FKnown for his chaotic demeanour and    
OL,8,Ftrademark Stetson hat, he interviewed  
OL,9,Fan array of stars, with the king on    
OL,10,FMonday calling him "a true giant of the
OL,11,Fmusic industry".                       
